WEBVTT

00:00:01.590 --> 00:00:03.730
Got it, Falulu-dechu?

00:00:03.730 --> 00:00:06.320
Make sure to eat your vegetables-dechu.

00:00:06.320 --> 00:00:09.550
Don't be too picky, eat both meat and fish,

00:00:09.550 --> 00:00:11.730
and don't forget to drink milk-dechu!

00:00:11.730 --> 00:00:13.660
There's no need to worry, Unicorn.

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:16.700
Call me if you come down with a cold-dechu!

00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:17.830
Got it.

00:00:17.830 --> 00:00:18.700
And-

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:20.710
Falulu-oneechan, keep your chin up!

00:00:20.710 --> 00:00:22.120
Do your best to get in the Parade!

00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:23.790
Make sure to message us!

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:25.090
You got it!

00:00:25.090 --> 00:00:26.560
And also...

00:00:26.560 --> 00:00:27.500
Yes?

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:29.810
Don't talk with people you don't know-dechu.

00:00:29.810 --> 00:00:32.130
Don't go with people you don't know-dechu!

00:00:32.130 --> 00:00:33.220
Understand?

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.430
Yes, Falulu understands.

00:00:35.430 --> 00:00:37.570
Talk to you later, Unicorn.

00:00:37.570 --> 00:00:38.480
Ah!

00:00:38.480 --> 00:00:39.680
She hung up.

00:00:41.150 --> 00:00:42.860
I'm already worried-dechu.

00:00:42.860 --> 00:00:44.500
Hey, hey, Unicorn...

00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:45.650
What is it-dechu?

00:00:45.650 --> 00:00:47.770
We're missing one.

00:00:48.050 --> 00:00:49.420
Missing...?

00:00:50.120 --> 00:00:52.190
What-dechu?!

00:00:54.650 --> 00:00:58.400
Falulu is going back to Parajuku's PriPara.

00:00:58.400 --> 00:01:02.120
Pripara is so much fun, and the people there are so nice.

00:01:02.460 --> 00:01:04.000
Falulu can't wait!

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:05.080
Gaalulu can't wait.

00:01:05.320 --> 00:01:06.180
Huh?!

00:01:06.180 --> 00:01:07.610
Gaalulu.

00:01:07.610 --> 00:01:10.090
Gaalulu?! Why?!

00:01:10.090 --> 00:01:13.550
Gaalulu is also going to Parajuku's PriPara.

00:01:13.550 --> 00:01:15.880
She wants to see everyone again!

00:01:15.880 --> 00:01:16.590
Sit down!

00:01:16.590 --> 00:01:19.450
Please stay calm while we're in flight.

00:01:19.450 --> 00:01:20.010
Shh!

00:02:51.420 --> 00:02:53.450
Princess Falulu

00:02:57.230 --> 00:02:59.030
Next is PriPara News.

00:02:59.400 --> 00:03:04.490
The town's in an uproar over the return of the Legendary Idol, Falulu-san.

00:03:04.720 --> 00:03:09.960
Instead of a brief return home, this time she'll be staying at Parajuku's PriPara for an extended period.

00:03:12.200 --> 00:03:16.050
We finally get to meet, Princess Falulu.

00:03:16.730 --> 00:03:18.340
What the heck, Gaalulu?!

00:03:18.640 --> 00:03:21.300
Why'd you do that without telling anyone-dechu?!

00:03:21.970 --> 00:03:23.910
Send her back as soon as you can, Falulu-dechu!

00:03:23.910 --> 00:03:25.510
PriPara announcement:

00:03:26.270 --> 00:03:29.910
We'll be arriving at Parajuku's PriPara momentarily.

00:03:29.910 --> 00:03:33.000
Please shut off and stow any electronic devices.

00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:34.250
We'll talk again later!

00:03:34.250 --> 00:03:35.720
Contact me as soon-

00:03:41.510 --> 00:03:43.030
Falulu's back!

00:03:43.030 --> 00:03:44.550
Welcome back, Falulu!

00:03:44.550 --> 00:03:46.370
Hold it right there-daVinci!

00:03:46.370 --> 00:03:47.340
Huh?

00:03:47.340 --> 00:03:49.970
Are you really Falulu-renoir?

00:03:49.970 --> 00:03:51.980
Or are you a fake-daVinci?!

00:03:51.980 --> 00:03:52.960
That hurts!

00:03:52.960 --> 00:03:54.080
Gaalulu!

00:03:54.080 --> 00:03:56.560
Oww-izumo!

00:03:56.560 --> 00:03:58.380
It... doesn't hurt?

00:03:58.380 --> 00:04:00.350
You came too, Gaalulu?!

00:04:00.350 --> 00:04:02.070
Welcome back, Gaalulu!

00:04:02.070 --> 00:04:03.560
Don't do that, Gaalulu!

00:04:03.560 --> 00:04:06.290
Don't worry, she's just play biting.

00:04:06.290 --> 00:04:08.400
Utamaro!

00:04:09.220 --> 00:04:11.640
You're interfering with police business-daVinci!

00:04:13.120 --> 00:04:16.450
Anyway, Gaalulu sure has grown.

00:04:16.450 --> 00:04:17.910
It's quite something.

00:04:17.910 --> 00:04:20.650
Vocal Dolls grow quickly.

00:04:23.520 --> 00:04:25.240
Falulu's back?!

00:04:25.240 --> 00:04:26.400
From PriPari?

00:04:26.400 --> 00:04:27.610
Really?

00:04:27.910 --> 00:04:29.760
Falulu came back!

00:04:29.760 --> 00:04:31.700
I have to go to her concert!

00:04:31.700 --> 00:04:33.150
Me too!

00:04:33.150 --> 00:04:34.830
Phantom Thief Genius?

00:04:34.830 --> 00:04:37.290
Who's that?

00:04:37.560 --> 00:04:41.240
He stole our SummDrea and AutDrea Coords!

00:04:41.240 --> 00:04:43.010
I max won't let him get away with it!

00:04:43.010 --> 00:04:46.100
I'll make sure to catch him-pri!

00:04:46.100 --> 00:04:50.930
That's why PriPara is up in arms-usa.

00:04:50.930 --> 00:04:53.680
We're sorry about the dreary mood-kuma.

00:04:54.190 --> 00:04:55.540
It's fine.

00:04:55.720 --> 00:04:58.800
Being able to see all of you again is more than enough.

00:04:58.800 --> 00:05:00.080
Same for Gaalulu!

00:05:00.080 --> 00:05:03.170
But you need to return to PriPari, Gaalulu!

00:05:03.170 --> 00:05:03.900
Why?

00:05:03.900 --> 00:05:06.370
Unicorn is worried.

00:05:06.370 --> 00:05:07.870
So you need to head back right away.

00:05:13.100 --> 00:05:17.780
Hey, Falulu, wouldn't one day be okay?

00:05:20.060 --> 00:05:23.460
Then one day, and only one day-dechu!

00:05:23.460 --> 00:05:26.380
You better come back tomorrow, you hear-dechu!

00:05:26.380 --> 00:05:27.950
Gaalulu!

00:05:27.950 --> 00:05:29.290
Gaalu!

00:05:29.480 --> 00:05:30.860
Isn't that great?

00:05:30.860 --> 00:05:32.180
Gaalu!

00:05:32.180 --> 00:05:36.350
Anyway, I'm surprised that Unicorn sent Falulu by herself.

00:05:36.350 --> 00:05:37.760
True.

00:05:37.760 --> 00:05:38.400
Go.

00:05:38.700 --> 00:05:43.100
Falulu also wants to be in the Dream Parade, so she asked Unicorn.

00:05:43.100 --> 00:05:46.140
So she said, "go and do your best".

00:05:46.860 --> 00:05:49.120
The appearance of a good rival.

00:05:49.120 --> 00:05:50.070
Go!

00:05:50.070 --> 00:05:53.540
Let's do our best and get in the parade!

00:05:53.540 --> 00:05:55.300
Yeah!
Go!

00:05:56.630 --> 00:06:00.000
Falulu-san, it's time for your welcome home ticket snapping event.

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:03.720
The PriTicket snapping event is over here!
I want to snap with Falulu-sama!

00:06:04.760 --> 00:06:07.090
Any suspicious people-dalí?!

00:06:07.090 --> 00:06:09.720
Find them-dalí and arrest them-daVinci!

00:06:10.970 --> 00:06:12.090
Here.

00:06:12.800 --> 00:06:14.160
Thank you so much!

00:06:14.160 --> 00:06:15.180
Hooray!

00:06:16.370 --> 00:06:20.150
Aloma Prophesy Grimoire, chapter 56, verse 98:

00:06:20.610 --> 00:06:24.470
"With this, thee shall become my servant"-dealo!

00:06:25.160 --> 00:06:28.360
By that she means we'll be friends after this!

00:06:28.900 --> 00:06:30.430
Thanks!

00:06:31.070 --> 00:06:32.690
Here.

00:06:32.690 --> 00:06:33.570
Friends-nano.

00:06:33.570 --> 00:06:36.870
Thanks for the fortune telling back then.

00:06:36.870 --> 00:06:37.600
Devi!

00:06:37.600 --> 00:06:38.890
Gel!

00:06:40.750 --> 00:06:42.960
Oh, little goats!

00:06:42.960 --> 00:06:45.770
They're all fans of yours.

00:06:47.760 --> 00:06:50.310
Thanks, little goats!

00:06:53.070 --> 00:06:55.700
Here.

00:06:56.890 --> 00:06:58.140
And you are?

00:06:58.540 --> 00:06:59.730
Fuwari.

00:06:59.730 --> 00:07:01.400
Midorikaze Fuwari.

00:07:01.400 --> 00:07:03.860
The former Princess Scholarship student.

00:07:03.860 --> 00:07:06.370
Guess she wasn't cut out for it.

00:07:06.370 --> 00:07:07.820
Dorothy...

00:07:09.120 --> 00:07:09.940
It's okay.

00:07:09.940 --> 00:07:11.230
She's right.

00:07:11.230 --> 00:07:12.670
It's Toriko's fault!

00:07:12.670 --> 00:07:16.290
Toriko would be a poor excuse for a Nagoya chicken!

00:07:16.290 --> 00:07:18.020
Astounding!

00:07:18.020 --> 00:07:20.570
That was some adventure we had back then.

00:07:20.570 --> 00:07:25.500
Everyone shouted "We'll get to be the princess!" back then.

00:07:25.500 --> 00:07:26.950
Sorry about that.

00:07:27.230 --> 00:07:30.080
No, it was Toriko's fault!

00:07:30.080 --> 00:07:31.800
Blame Toriko!

00:07:31.800 --> 00:07:37.470
<i>Now that I think about it, Genius showed up just after Fuwari stepped down from being the princess.</i>

00:07:37.470 --> 00:07:39.490
<i>Is it a coincidence-pri?</i>

00:07:39.680 --> 00:07:41.880
Nice to meet you, Fuwari.

00:07:41.880 --> 00:07:43.920
Same to you, Falulu.

00:07:43.920 --> 00:07:46.300
With this, we're all friends!

00:07:46.300 --> 00:07:47.280
Yep.

00:07:49.000 --> 00:07:53.170
After Falulu's done with her event,
why don't we all go get crepes?

00:07:53.170 --> 00:07:54.320
Yeah, that sounds wonderful.

00:07:54.320 --> 00:07:56.120
Yeah!
Go!

00:07:56.910 --> 00:07:59.840
Gaalulu's nibbling event is over here!

00:07:59.840 --> 00:08:00.850
Gaalu!

00:08:00.850 --> 00:08:02.020
Nibbling event?

00:08:02.020 --> 00:08:03.460
What's that-usa?

00:08:03.460 --> 00:08:05.640
Usa...

00:08:05.640 --> 00:08:10.880
Actually, I could get addicted to this exquisite painless and itchless play biting-usa.

00:08:11.400 --> 00:08:13.540
It'd probably work on a stiff neck-kuma.

00:08:13.540 --> 00:08:14.840
A little rougher...

00:08:15.940 --> 00:08:17.800
Chew more! Chew more!

00:08:17.800 --> 00:08:18.810
W-Wait!

00:08:20.440 --> 00:08:22.100
Don't eat her.

00:08:24.540 --> 00:08:27.610
Falulu-san, it's time for your interview.

00:08:28.590 --> 00:08:31.570
So, Falulu-san, you were an extraordinary idol even in PriPari, yes?

00:08:31.910 --> 00:08:35.280
That's because Unicorn and the Mini Falulu's are all cheering for Falulu.

00:08:35.690 --> 00:08:38.890
You really do have quite the impressive manager and friends.

00:08:40.320 --> 00:08:41.500
Wow!

00:08:41.750 --> 00:08:44.960
These ox-eye daisies are beautiful.

00:08:45.730 --> 00:08:49.920
The flower seeds you gave me turned out so beautiful!

00:08:50.440 --> 00:08:52.480
I'm giving this one to you, Falulu-sama.

00:08:52.480 --> 00:08:54.700
Thank you, Non-chan.

00:08:54.700 --> 00:08:56.090
Falulu-san!

00:08:56.090 --> 00:08:56.640
Huh?

00:08:56.640 --> 00:08:58.600
We're ready!

00:08:58.600 --> 00:09:00.950
Let's get this gravure photoshoot under way.

00:09:00.950 --> 00:09:02.340
Okay!

00:09:03.090 --> 00:09:04.740
That concludes our photoshoot.

00:09:04.740 --> 00:09:06.600
Nice working with you.

00:09:06.920 --> 00:09:08.410
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:09:08.410 --> 00:09:10.750
Nice work today!

00:09:10.750 --> 00:09:13.160
PriPara announcement:

00:09:13.160 --> 00:09:17.350
To all idols here, PriPara will soon be closing for the day.

00:09:17.350 --> 00:09:19.550
Please be careful on your way home.

00:09:19.550 --> 00:09:22.180
And enjoy your time in PriPara until then.

00:09:22.180 --> 00:09:23.690
Eh? Already?!

00:09:23.690 --> 00:09:25.630
We'll see them again tomorrow, Dorothy.

00:09:25.630 --> 00:09:28.500
Let's head home in groups!

00:09:29.640 --> 00:09:31.760
Everyone's heading home?

00:09:32.420 --> 00:09:33.560
See you tomorrow.

00:09:33.560 --> 00:09:35.370
Today was a lot of fun-pri!

00:09:35.370 --> 00:09:37.740
See you later, Gaalulu.

00:09:37.740 --> 00:09:39.090
Gaalu...

00:09:42.920 --> 00:09:45.890
Why isn't Falulu heading home?

00:09:45.890 --> 00:09:48.850
It's because she's a Vocal Doll.

00:09:49.300 --> 00:09:51.660
This is Falulu's home.

00:09:52.930 --> 00:09:55.030
Mikan's starving-nano!

00:09:55.030 --> 00:09:56.940
Let's head home and have dinner-devi!

00:10:03.210 --> 00:10:04.710
Let's head in.

00:10:06.830 --> 00:10:08.140
Gaalu.

00:10:11.960 --> 00:10:23.350
♪I've already fallen in love with the world♪

00:10:33.880 --> 00:10:34.810
I know!

00:10:34.810 --> 00:10:37.740
I wonder what Kuma-san and Usagi-san are doing?

00:10:38.280 --> 00:10:41.540
Oh? You came again today?

00:10:41.540 --> 00:10:43.160
That makes me happy-nekon.

00:10:43.160 --> 00:10:45.010
Of course-kuma!

00:10:45.010 --> 00:10:47.410
This is paradise-usa!

00:10:47.410 --> 00:10:50.880
I also want to drink with you two-nekon.

00:10:53.420 --> 00:10:55.150
I'll have a new bottle of vegetable juice!

00:10:55.150 --> 00:10:56.050
Same here!

00:10:56.050 --> 00:11:00.510
Here's your new bottle!
Yes, a new bottle!

00:11:01.100 --> 00:11:05.970
Falulu should probably head to bed about now so she'll be ready for tomorrow.

00:11:07.930 --> 00:11:11.150
Are Unicorn and the others doing okay?

00:11:11.890 --> 00:11:13.010
No, bad!

00:11:13.010 --> 00:11:15.600
Falulu decided she'd do her best even though she's alone!

00:11:15.600 --> 00:11:18.330
Unicorn and the others are all cheering for Falulu.

00:11:18.330 --> 00:11:19.480
Huh?

00:11:19.480 --> 00:11:20.110
Ack!

00:11:20.420 --> 00:11:26.310
Falulu's Non!

00:11:29.510 --> 00:11:30.660
Who's there?

00:11:37.150 --> 00:11:52.880
Bonsoir, Princess.

00:11:54.430 --> 00:11:58.570
Falulu, I've been wanting to meet you for a long time.

00:12:01.080 --> 00:12:04.220
Are you spending the evening alone?

00:12:04.220 --> 00:12:06.720
In that case, if you would allow me to speak with you...

00:12:07.390 --> 00:12:08.750
...I'd be honoured.

00:12:09.600 --> 00:12:11.290
Do you feel threatened?

00:12:12.760 --> 00:12:14.290
It's like a dream come true.

00:12:14.290 --> 00:12:15.990
For a Legendary Idol...

00:12:17.280 --> 00:12:20.010
<i>Don't talk with people you don't know-dechu.</i>

00:12:20.010 --> 00:12:22.400
I'm no one suspicious.

00:12:29.220 --> 00:12:31.680
Just what game are we playing?

00:12:39.430 --> 00:12:41.360
Here. Good as new.

00:12:46.640 --> 00:12:47.920
Thank you!

00:12:47.920 --> 00:12:48.590
Ah!

00:12:48.590 --> 00:12:51.410
Falulu talked with someone she doesn't know.

00:12:52.210 --> 00:12:54.180
So that's what it was.

00:12:54.640 --> 00:12:57.740
But now we are no longer strangers, right?

00:12:57.740 --> 00:12:59.380
Eh? Why do you say that?

00:12:59.380 --> 00:13:02.840
Because it's already been five minutes since we met.

00:13:05.680 --> 00:13:07.010
Here...

00:13:08.220 --> 00:13:12.770
As thanks for fixing Falulu's Non.

00:13:14.770 --> 00:13:17.540
Aren't those important to you?

00:13:17.540 --> 00:13:20.280
Since you fixed something important,

00:13:20.280 --> 00:13:23.730
Falulu should give you something important as thanks.

00:13:24.170 --> 00:13:28.350
In that case, would you be willing to dance with me instead?

00:13:32.400 --> 00:13:36.420
I am a magician who is protecting PriPara.

00:13:36.710 --> 00:13:38.160
Protecting PriPara?

00:13:38.160 --> 00:13:40.380
And I also desire...

00:13:41.150 --> 00:13:42.840
...to be your one and only man.

00:13:42.840 --> 00:13:46.460
A guy has made it into PriPara?

00:13:46.460 --> 00:13:48.690
Because I'm a magician.

00:13:48.690 --> 00:13:50.570
Really?

00:13:50.570 --> 00:13:52.850
I've long been awaiting this moment...

00:13:53.370 --> 00:13:55.560
The moment I get to meet you.

00:14:13.470 --> 00:14:15.080
My, look how drunk you are.

00:14:15.570 --> 00:14:18.040
Oh, what a beautiful moon-nekon.

00:14:27.030 --> 00:14:31.670
Magician-san, what do you mean by protecting PriPara?

00:14:33.430 --> 00:14:42.900
Those who currently partake in PriPara cannot fully control the true sparkle that has been lying mostly dormant in their coords.

00:14:43.610 --> 00:14:46.790
I want to revolutionise PriPara,

00:14:46.790 --> 00:14:53.330
and to do that, I must find five princesses and create an idol team known as the Princess Team.

00:14:53.700 --> 00:14:57.290
I want to help PriPara grow into something more beautiful.

00:14:57.880 --> 00:14:59.790
Princess Team...

00:15:00.100 --> 00:15:02.660
And I need you to achieve that.

00:15:03.080 --> 00:15:05.500
Please choose my team above all others,

00:15:06.320 --> 00:15:07.950
Princess Falulu.

00:15:07.950 --> 00:15:10.730
Me... a princess?

00:15:10.730 --> 00:15:11.570
Falulu!

00:15:11.570 --> 00:15:12.390
Huh?

00:15:12.390 --> 00:15:14.600
No biting Falulu!

00:15:17.430 --> 00:15:18.890
Gaalulu, stop!

00:15:19.160 --> 00:15:19.850
Gaalulu, stop! Stay away from him.

00:15:19.850 --> 00:15:22.650
Gaalulu will do her best to protect Falulu-oneechan!

00:15:24.810 --> 00:15:26.560
Princess Falulu,

00:15:26.560 --> 00:15:28.640
please keep this a secret between the two of us.

00:15:28.640 --> 00:15:31.240
If you tell anyone, I will disappear.

00:15:33.200 --> 00:15:35.560
Now then, it was a pleasure, Princess...

00:15:35.560 --> 00:15:37.770
...and Little Princess.

00:15:40.200 --> 00:15:42.140
Magician-san...

00:15:42.140 --> 00:15:43.820
Gaalu...

00:15:47.480 --> 00:15:51.300
It's finally time for your one year anniversary concert, Falulu!

00:15:51.300 --> 00:15:53.040
According to Mirei's calculations,

00:15:53.040 --> 00:15:56.080
you're expected to jump up the rankings even further!

00:15:56.080 --> 00:15:57.260
Good luck!

00:15:57.680 --> 00:15:59.270
Capisce!

00:15:59.270 --> 00:16:01.230
Um, Sophie...

00:16:01.230 --> 00:16:03.480
On Falulu's balcony last night...

00:16:04.190 --> 00:16:06.370
Not now. It's a secret.

00:16:06.370 --> 00:16:07.150
Mmm.

00:16:15.620 --> 00:16:17.910
Please scan the appropriate number of My Tickets for your coord.

00:16:19.160 --> 00:16:21.410
Coord Change Start!

00:16:21.850 --> 00:16:24.940
Falulu-san's coord has been upgraded to gold!

00:16:24.940 --> 00:16:27.020
And along with the rainbow-coloured shimmer of her snowflake jewellery,

00:16:27.020 --> 00:16:28.640
it's luxurious and dazzling.

00:16:28.640 --> 00:16:30.510
Jewellery Princess Coord!

00:16:36.700 --> 00:16:38.760
Falulu's home!

00:16:38.760 --> 00:16:40.820
Welcome back, Falulu!

00:16:40.820 --> 00:16:43.770
Falulu has returned to PriPara!

00:16:43.770 --> 00:16:46.940
She loves this town, PriPara, and all of you!

00:16:46.940 --> 00:16:48.780
We've been waiting for you!

00:16:49.760 --> 00:16:51.940
We've missed you!

00:16:52.840 --> 00:16:55.450
We love you, Falulu!

00:16:55.940 --> 00:16:57.950
Falulu-sama!

